cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use HelioFITS Peek in your research, please cite the version you used
  (each release has its own Zenodo DOI). If you use the RHEF filter, please
  also cite Gilly and Cranmer (2025).
type: software
title: HelioFITS Peek
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23749496
version: 1.5.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
abstract: >-
  HelioFITS Peek teaches macOS Finder and Quick Look to read solar FITS files. A
  thumbnail extension renders each file in the colormap its header calls for,
  a Quick Look extension gives an interactive preview with pixel values,
  helioprojective coordinates, region statistics and multi-HDU blink
  comparison, and a Spotlight importer makes header fields searchable. A
  viewer app shows the full header, exports PNG and copies a sunpy snippet
  that loads the HDU on screen.
